nance, just like over a million businesses - with a bank that always works.",img:"/business/personal-account.png"},benefitsSub:{title:"Why you should get a Moniepoint <em>Personal Account</em>",ctaLink:m.KW,benefits:[{title:"Pay with transfer  without charges",desc:"Better fees, faster network. Pay at all your favourite businesses with the banking solution that they trust.",img:"/business/personal-banking-1.png"},{title:"No more failed card transactions",desc:"Get a debit card in 48 hours, activate it on your app, and enjoy hassle-free payments.",img:"/business/personal-banking-2.png"},{title:"Manage your Money",desc:"Save, request a salary advance, and get insight on your spending, all with your Moniepoint account.",img:"/business/personal-banking-3.png"},{title:"A banking experience you control",desc:"Manage your finance from your app. Make transfers, pay bills, and purchase airtime, all with the touch of a button.",img:"/business/personal-banking-4.png"}]},getStarted:{title:"Open an account in 5 minutes",steps:[{title:"Download the app",desc:"Visit the Playstore or App Store to download the Moniepoint app and get started.",img:"/start/per-1.png"},{title:"Sign up",desc:"Provide your email and phone number and verify your phone number with an OTP.",img:"/start/per-2.png"},{title:"Verify your details",desc:"Select username & password. Provide your BVN and KYC details and start face & ID verification.",img:"/start/per-3.png"},{title:"Enjoy seamless banking",desc:"Fund your account and make transactions - transfer, buy airtime or pay bills.",img:"/start/per-4.png"}]},benefits:{subtext:"Enjoy secure Banking, with roundthe clock support",list:[{title:"As secure as you expect.",desc:"Moniepoint uses up-to-date cybersecurity technology to protect your information and prevent unauthorised use.",img:"/benefits/secure.svg"},{title:"Protection and peace of mind",desc:"Your funds are insured for up to N250,000 by the Nigerian Deposit Insurance Corporation.",img:"/benefits/protection.svg"},{title:"Anytime, anywhere, support",desc:"We’re always here to talk. Reach our support team however you need to - by phone, email, in the app, or check out the Help Center.",img:"/benefits/anytime.svg"}]},faqs:[{question:"How can I open a savings account with your bank?",answer:"To open a savings account, simply download the Moniepoint Personal Banking app to get started and follow the prompt."},{question:"What is the minimum initial deposit required to open a savings account?",answer:"Opening an account with Moniepoint is free. There is no initial deposit required."},{question:"Does the Moniepoint Personal Bank Account have a minimum balance requirement?",answer:"No, there is no minimum balance required."},{question:"Are there any monthly maintenance fees associated with the savings account?",answer:"No, there are no monthly maintenance fees or charges."},{question:"Are there any restrictions or penalties for withdrawing money from my account?",answer:"No, you can withdraw your money as many times as you like."},{question:"Can I set up automatic transfers or direct deposits into my savings account to help with saving?",answer:"Yes, you can typically set up automatic transfers or direct deposits into your Moniepoint savings account to help with your savings goals. This can be a convenient way to save regularly."},{question:"What are the options for receiving statements and monitoring account activity?",answer:"Account statements and activity are available through our online banking, mobile apps, email statements, and SMS channels."},{question:"Is my money safe with Moniepoint?",answer:"Moniepoint Microfinance Bank is authorized and regulated by the Central Bank of Nigeria to offer banking services. Deposits are insured by the Nigerian Deposit Insurance Corporation (NDIC)."}],cta:{ctaTitle:"Experience banking that works",ctaLink:m.KW,ctaText:"Open an account"},ctaD:{ctaTitle:"Over 2 <em>million</em> people trust us with their <em>business finance</em>",ctaLink:m.KW,ctaText:"Come join us"},script:p.v.personalBanking,disabled:!1},"instant-debit-card":{meta:y.s.personal["instant-debit-card"],marquee:!0,hero:{tag:"Instant Debit Card",title:"Need to pay online or in person?",desc:"Withdraw, Pay online, or in-person with ease using a Moniepoint debit card",img:"/personal/card-hero.png"},benefitsSub:{title:"One card for all your <em>spending needs</em>",ctaLink:m.KW,benefits:[{title:"Quick delivery (wherever you are)",desc:"Order from wherever you are, and get it within 48 hrs",img:"/business/debit-card-1.png"},{title:"Experience a card you fully control",desc:"Activate your card from within your app. If it ever goes missing, No worries. Deactivate it in-app without hassles.",img:"/business/debit-card-2.png"},{title:"Works literally anywhere",desc:"Works with ATMs, POS terminals, and more",img:"/business/debit-card-3.png"},{title:"Seamless payments on our terminals",desc:"Enjoy card payments that go through everytime on Moniepoint terminals",img:"/business/debit-card-4.png"}]},getStarted:{title:"Open an account in 5 minutes",steps:[{title:"Download the app",desc:"Visit the Playstore or App Store to download the Moniepoint app and get started.",img:"/start/ins-1.png"},{title:"Sign up",desc:"Provide your email and phone number and verify your phone number with an OTP.",img:"/start/ins-2.png"},{title:"Verify your details",desc:"Select username & password. Provide your BVN and KYC details and start face & ID verification.",img:"/start/ins-3.png"},{title:"Enjoy seamless banking",desc:"Fund your account and make transactions - transfer, buy airtime or pay bills.",img:"/start/ins-4.png"}]},benefits:{subtext:"Enjoy secure Banking, with roundthe clock support",list:[{title:"Say goodbye to card downtimes",desc:"Enjoy payments that go through every time with the Moniepoint cards. Pay with ease wherever you see the blue Moniepoint terminal.",img:"/benefits/card.svg"},{title:"Enjoy 24/7 card and account support",desc:"You probably won’t need it, but if you ever want to reach out, our support team is here for you. At all times.",img:"/benefits/anytime.svg"}]},faqs:[{question:"What is a debit card?",answer:"A debit card is a payment card that allows you to make purchases by deducting funds directly from your linked bank account, often with the option to withdraw cash from ATMs."},{question:"How do I request a Moniepoint Debit Card?",answer:"Simply download the Moniepoint app to request your debit card. Cards are delivered within 48hrs to your doorstep."},{question:"How long does it take to receive my debit card after applying for it?",answer:"Within 48hours."},{question:"How do I activate my Debit card?",answer:"To activate your Moniepoint Debit Card,open the app and activate your card."},{question:"Where can I use my Moniepoint Debit Card?",answer:"You can use your Moniepoint Debit Card at any merchant, POS or ATM that accepts debit card payments."},{question:"How many ATMs accept the Moniepoint Debit Cards?",answer:"Moniepoint Debit Cards are accepted at all ATMS nationwide"},{question:"What do I do if my Moniepoint Debit Card is lost, stolen or misplaced?",answer:"If your debit card is lost, stolen, or misplaced, you should immediately disable it through the mobile app and contact Moniepoint's customer service to report it."},{question:"What do I do if I forget my pin?",answer:"If you forget your PIN for your Moniepoint Debit Card, you can reset it through the mobile app or online banking."},{question:"What is the daily or monthly spending limit on my debit card?",answer:"There is no daily, weekly or monthly spending limit on your debit card."},{question:"Can I use my debit card for online purchases, and is it secured for online transactions?",answer:"Yes, you can use your Moniepoint Debit Card for online purchases, and it is often secured for online transactions\xa0"}],cta:{ctaTitle:"Enjoy seamless payments with Moniepoint",ctaLink:m.KW,ctaText:"Get started"},script:p.v.personalCards,disabled:!1},payment:{meta:y.s.personal.payment,hero:{tag:"Payments",title:"Enjoy seamless payments every time.",desc:"Make transfers, pay bills, get data, buy airtime. We got you.",img:"/business/payments.png"},benefitsSub:{title:"Get started with seamless payments anytime",ctaLink:m.KW,benefits:[{title:"Easy refunds and reversals",desc:"Say goodbye to failed transactions and unreversed debits. Manage and monitor refunds within the app.",img:"/business/payment-1.png"},{title:"Get more for less at any Moniepoint merchant",desc:"Pay seamlessly at any Moniepoint business for free. All the speed, all the reliability, at 0 costs.",img:"/business/payment-2.png"},{title:"Transfer to Moniepoint or other bank users",desc:"Enjoy transfers that always go through from Moniepoint to Moniepoint or any other bank.",img:"/business/payment-3.png"},{title:"Pay bills, Buy airtime and data",desc:"We can’t stop the bills from coming, but we can make paying them as easy as possible.",img:"/business/payment-4.png"}]},getStarted:{title:"Open an account in 5 minutes",steps:[{title:"Download the app",desc:"Visit the Playstore or App Store to download the Moniepoint app and get started.",img:"/start/pmt-1.png"},{title:"Sign up",desc:"Provide your email and phone number and verify your phone number with an OTP.",img:"/start/pmt-2.png"},{title:"Verify your details",desc:"Select username & password. Provide your BVN and KYC details and start face & ID verification.",img:"/start/pmt-3.png"},{title:"Enjoy seamless banking",desc:"Fund your account and make transactions - transfer, buy airtime or pay bills.",img:"/start/pmt-4.png"}]},faqs:[{question:"What bills can I pay with the Moniepoint app?",answer:"With the Moniepoint app, you can pay your electricity bill , waste bill , internet bill, streaming service and more."},{question:"Is it possible to set up automatic bill payments?",answer:"Yes, you can schedule automatic bill payments in advance through the Moniepoint app."},{question:"Can I purchase data and airtime for my mobile phone?",answer:"Yes, you can buy data or airtime for yourself or any other person through the mobile app."},{question:"Are there any transaction fees associated with paying bills on the Moniepoint app?",answer:"There is no extra transaction fee associated with paying your bills using the Moniepoint app."},{question:"How quickly are payments processed?",answer:"Payments are processed immediately through the Moniepoint app."},{question:"Can I view my payment history and transaction receipts through your platform for record-keeping purposes?",answer:"Yes, you can view your payment history and access transaction history through the Moniepoint app or your online account. This feature is useful for record-keeping and tracking your financial transactions."}],cta:{ctaTitle:"Experience banking that works",ctaDesc:"We’re powering the dreams of millions of businesses.",ctaLink:m.KW,ctaText:"Open an account"},ctaD:{ctaTitle:"No hidden <em>fees</em> or <em>charges</em>",ctaLink:m.KW,ctaText:"Come join us"},script:p.v.personalPayment,disabled:!1},savings:{meta:y.s.personal.savings,hero:{tag:"Savings",title:"Make your dreams happen with a savings plan",desc:"Sign up for a savings plan, save for your dreams, and get up to 18% interest annually when you save. Start a savings plan with a minimum deposit of ₦1,000 today.",img:"/personal/savings-hero.png"},benefitsSub:{title:"A smart way to grow your money",desc:"Choose how, when and what to save with a plan designed to achieve your dreams.",ctaLink:m.KW,ctaText:"Find your savings plan",benefits:[{title:"Save and withdraw whenever",desc:"Enjoy the flexibility of saving and accessing your funds anytime without penalties. ",img:"/personal/savings-d-1.png"},{title:"Access competitive interest rates",desc:"Enjoy up to 18% interest annually as a reward for saving.",img:"/personal/savings-d-2.png"},{title:"NDIC-secured",desc:"Feel at peace, saving your money and knowing it is fully protected.",img:"/personal/savings-d-3.png"},{title:"Halal compliant for Muslim users",desc:"You can choose to make your savings interest-free.",img:"/personal/savings-d-4.png"},{title:"Top up and roll over plans easily",desc:"Add more money before maturity or rollover your interest and savings at the end of the plan",img:"/personal/savings-d-5.png"}]},subProduct:{title:"Plans designed for your dreams",desc:"With just ₦1,000 as your starting balance, you can begin saving for your dreams.",subs:[{title:"Flexible Savings",desc:"Your personal emergency go-to wallet for rainy days. Start with a minimum balance of ₦1,000 and enjoy a flat rate interest of 9% annually.",ctaText:"Learn more",ctaLink:"/ng/savings/flexible-savings",img:"/personal/savings-1.png"},{title:"Locked Savings",desc:"It is a smart and safe way to lock away funds for a fixed amount of time and accrue up to 16% interest annually.",ctaText:"Learn more",ctaLink:"/ng/savings/locked-savings",img:"/personal/savings-2.png"},{title:"Fixed Savings",desc:"A disciplined way to set aside huge sums for those big-budget, long-term and future projects. You can enjoy up to 18% interest annually.",ctaText:"Learn more",ctaLink:"/ng/savings/fixed-savings",img:"/personal/savings-3.png"}]},faqs:[{question:"What is the minimum amount required to start a savings plan?",answer:"₦1,000"},{question:"Can I change the duration or tenure of my savings plan?",answer:"Yes, you can change the duration of your savings plan after creating it by going through the Manage plan flow to make any necessary changes."},{question:"Is there a penalty for withdrawing before the maturity date?",answer:"Penalties depend on your savings plan of choice. <br/><strong>Flexible Savings</strong> - No penalties <br/> <strong>Locked Savings & Fixed Savings</strong> - You lose all accrued interest.\xa0"},{question:"Is the interest rate fixed or variable for the savings plans?",answer:"<strong>Flexible Savings</strong> - Interest is fixed at a flat rate of 9% p.a. <br/>  <strong>Locked Savings & Fixed Savings</strong> - Interest varies based on tenure but can go as high as 16% p.a."},{question:"How frequently is the interest credited to my savings account?",answer:"Flexible Savings - Interest is accrued daily and paid at the end of every month.\xa0<br/>  Locked Savings - You can access interest at the end of your savings cycle<br/>  Fixed Savings - Interest is paid upfront.\xa0"},{question:"Can I have multiple savings plans simultaneously?",answer:"Yes, you can have as many savings plans as you desire"},{question:"What are the benefits of opting for a rollover at maturity?",answer:"Rollover at maturity allows you to maintain the same savings plan at any tenure you choose, making it easier to reconcile your savings instead of creating a new one."},{question:"Is there a limit on the number of rollovers I can perform?",answer:"No, there is not."}],cta:{ctaTitle:"Let’s power yours too.",ctaDesc:"We’re powering the dreams of thousands of businesses.",ctaLink:m.KW,ctaText:"Open an account"},disabled:!g.v.showSavingsPages}};var b=()=>{let e=(0,i.ac)("(max-width: 768px)"),n=e?8:16,s=["/businesses/max.png","/businesses/migo.png","/businesses/bamboo.png","/businesses/fairmoney.png","/businesses/payu.png","/businesses/piggyvest.png","/businesses/cowrywise.png","/businesses/cubana.png","/businesses/jendol.png","/businesses/theplace.png","/businesses/jumiapay.png","/businesses/kongapay.png","/businesses/quickcheck.png","/businesses/gigm.png"];return(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:u().bus,children:[(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:u()["bus-top"],children:[(0,t.jsxs)("h2",{children:["All your favourite ",(0,t.jsx)("em",{children:"businesses"})," use Moniepoint, and you can now"," ",(0,t.jsx)("em",{children:"pay to them"})," with ease."]}),(0,t.jsx)(o.Button,{link:!0,href:m.KW,children:"Get a Moniepoint Card"})]}),(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:u()["bus-main"],children:[(0,t.jsx)(o.Marquee,{repeat:3,duration:40,classNameInner:u()["bus-main-marquee"],children:s.slice(0,n).map((e,n)