he size or location of your business."}},personal:{landing:{title:"Moniepoint Personal",description:"Moniepoint offers a wide range of personal banking services including savings accounts, debit cards, personal loans and much more. Open an account today."},"instant-debit-card":{title:"Debit Cards - Get A Moniepoint Instant Debit Card Today",description:"Need to make payment online or in person? Get a Moniepoint debit card today and enjoy rewards and exciting benefits. Apply now."},payment:{title:"Bills Payment - Pay Utility Bills, Buy Data and Airtime Online",description:"Make payment easily and securely. Moniepoint payment solutions offer you a platform to pay utility bills, buy data or airtime, male transfer and much more securely and faster"},"personal-account":{title:"Personal Banking - Open A Bank Account Online",description:"Moniepoint MFB has a wide range of personal banking services to help you manage your bank account online. Transfer, save, invest, and much more. Open an account today."},savings:{title:"Save Money Online - Enjoy High Returns On Your Savings",description:"Achieve your personal and financial goals with Moniepoint. Save online today and enjoy high interest on our savings plans. Get started today."}},savings:{"flexible-savings":{title:"Flexible Savings Plan - Earn up to 9% p.a on your Savings",description:"Maximize your money with our flexible savings plan. Get up 9% interest on your savings and enjoy more benefits on your plan. Get started today"},"locked-savings":{title:"Locked Savings Plan - Earn up to 16% p.a on your Savings",description:"Maximize your money with our locked savings plan. Get up 16% interest on your savings and enjoy more benefits on your plan. Get started today"},"fixed-savings":{title:"Fixed Savings Account - Earn up to 16% p.a on your Savings",description:"Maximize your money with our high-yield fixed savings plan. Get up 16% interest on your savings and enjoy more benefits on your plan. Get started today"}},"digital-banking":{title:"Online Banking - Download Moniepoint Banking App",description:"Moniepoint offers seamless digital banking solutions for businesses and individuals, enhancing financial inclusion and empowering growth."},ussd:{title:"Moniepoint USSD Banking - Dial *5573# For Easy Mobile Banking",description:"Use Moniepoint USSD Code #5573# for easy offline banking. Transfer, buy airtime, data and pay bills. Try it today!"},"cac-business-name-registration":{title:"CAC Business Name Registration - Register Your Business Name",description:"Streamline your business registration with Moniepoint! Easily register your business name via our banking dashboard and get CAC-approved in just 14 days. Start now!"},"cac-business-registration":{title:"Easily register your Business/Company with CAC",description:"Conveniently register your business or company with the Corporate Affairs Commission (CAC) from the comfort of your Moniepoint Business Banking app."}}},8641:function(e){e.exports={"bus-top":"business_bus-top__H5C9v","card-container":"business_card-container__SQtmn","card-item-left":"business_card-item-left__2B5z0","bus-main-marquee":"business_bus-main-marquee__pWorj","card-item":"business_card-item__ekT0w","hero-label":"business_hero-label__YRO_G","hero-cert":"business_hero-cert__lMeyL","hero-left":"business_hero-left__KBqd8","hero-container":"business_hero-container__izvco",hide:"business_hide__dgPeZ",show:"business_show__XuIIE",word:"business_word__3Y4XH",whitespace:"business_whitespace___4arI",dnone:"business_dnone__WMomX","card-item-right":"business_card-item-right__NWw9O",business:"business_business__2P87y",hero:"business_hero__ia0_B","hero-footer":"business_hero-footer__xMn2G","hero-right":"business_hero-right__tTJjG",card:"business_card__9fdMS",start:"business_start__yJBA0",bus:"business_bus__IY207","bus-main":"business_bus-main__Muzsn"}}},function(e){e.O(0,[4964,3916,3424,6146,6912,2888,9774,179],function(){return e(e.s=4488)}),_N_E=e.O()}]);